#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/configuration/tools.md:11
msgid ""
"Tools preserve actual process exits and input identities. A prepared plan is"
" not execution evidence; a model pass is not physical qualification. Run "
"maintained commands from the repository root with the selected tools on "
"`PATH`."
msgstr ""
"工具保留真实进程退出码与输入身份。准备计划不是执行证据；模型通过不是物理资格。从仓库根目录运行维护命令，并将所选工具放在 `PATH` 上。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/configuration/tools.md:15
msgid ""
"Use the [fixed source checkout guide](../../guides/source-checkout.md) "
