#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/configuration/tools.md:41
msgid ""
"Fresh reports require nonzero actual executions and original logs. A missing"
" tool, empty XML, skipped-only run, stale output or changed input cannot "
"satisfy a gate. Do not filter or shard complete acceptance runs. Development"
" subsets retain their limited scope and cannot close a full candidate exit."
msgstr ""
"新报告要求实际执行数量大于零，并保留原始日志。工具缺失、空 "
"XML、只有跳过的运行、陈旧输出或输入变化都不能通过门禁。完整验收执行不得过滤或分片。开发子集保留有限范围，不能关闭完整候选退出条件。"


msgid "Managed build-directory ownership"
msgstr "托管构建目录所有权"

msgid "Managed configure/build/test/check, TDD, Native runtime and matrix entries share one kernel lock per canonical build directory through all stages and report publication. An independent managed execution in that directory rejects immediately; separate build directories can run in parallel. Independent command logs do not make a shared build directory safe."
msgstr "托管 configure／build／test／check、TDD、Native runtime 和 matrix 共用每个规范构建目录的内核锁，覆盖所有阶段及报告发布。同目录另一独立托管执行立即拒绝，不同构建目录可以并行。独立命令日志不能保证共享构建目录安全。"

msgid "POSIX nested commands inherit real file descriptors after directory and file identity checks. Same-thread composition is reentrant; other threads do not automatically inherit ownership. Cancellation drains owned processes before the last descriptor releases the lock. Windows supports standalone file locks; nested managed execution explicitly requires POSIX descriptor inheritance. Descriptor inheritance delegates ownership within one orchestration. The parent must serialize child stages using the same build directory; children sharing one delegated descriptor are not mutually exclusive. Direct CMake, Ninja and CTest do not participate; keep those directories exclusive until direct commands finish. This coordination does not establish Windows matrix or firmware qualification."
msgstr "POSIX 嵌套命令在核对目录与文件身份后继承真实文件描述符。同线程组合可重入，其他线程不自动继承所有权。取消先排空所属进程，再由最后一个描述符释放锁。Windows 支持独立文件锁，嵌套托管执行明确要求 POSIX 描述符继承。继承描述符表示同一编排内的委托；父编排必须串行执行同目录子阶段，共享同一委托描述符的子进程之间不自动互斥。直接 CMake、Ninja 和 CTest 不参与；直接命令完成前保持目录独占。这项协调不建立 Windows 矩阵或固件资格。"
